#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_stripe_express_checkout/js/express_checkout.js
msgid "Enter a valid amount (up to two decimal places)."
msgstr ""

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:1567
msgid "I understand that this payment is not a subscription for premium features."
msgstr "Rozumiem, že táto platba nie je predplatné prémiových funkcií."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:686
msgid "Premium access is not activated when you start payment from this project page in Rovas. Start your order from the project's own application."
msgstr "Prémiový prístup sa neaktivuje, ak platbu začnete z tejto stránky projektu v Rováši. Objednávku musíte začať v aplikácii projektu."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:708
msgid "Premium access is granted only when you start your order on !site and pay at least !thresholds (payment still takes place here on Rovas). Starting payment from this project page in Rovas does not activate premium."
msgstr "Prémiový prístup získate len ak objednávku začnete na !site a zaplatíte aspoň !thresholds (platba prebehne tu v Rováši). Platba začatá z tejto stránky projektu v Rováši prémiu neaktivuje."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:714
msgid "Premium access is granted only when you start your order from the project's own application and pay at least !thresholds (payment still takes place here on Rovas). Starting payment from this project page in Rovas does not activate premium."
msgstr "Prémiový prístup získate len ak objednávku začnete v aplikácii projektu a zaplatíte aspoň !thresholds (platba prebehne tu v Rováši). Platba začatá z tejto stránky projektu v Rováši prémiu neaktivuje."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:2145
msgid "Please confirm that you understand this payment is not a subscription for premium features."
msgstr "Potvrďte, že rozumiete, že táto platba nie je predplatné prémiových funkcií."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:62
msgid "Disable Stripe card, Express Checkout and bank transfer"
msgstr "Vypnúť platbu kartou (Stripe), Express Checkout a bankovný prevod"

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:64
msgid ""
"When checked, the /rewpro form hides \"Pay by card\", \"Pay with bank "
"transfer\" and the Express Checkout (Apple/Google Pay, Link, etc.) section. "
"Only Chron payments are accepted, both for direct project-page rewards and "
"for 3rd-party app orders that land on /rewpro. Anonymous visitors are asked "
"to log in. Existing orders already in checkout are not affected; only new "
"payments are blocked."
msgstr ""
"Po zaškrtnutí formulár /rewpro skryje tlačidlá „Zaplatiť kartou“ a „Zaplatiť "
"bankovým prevodom“ a sekciu Express Checkout (Apple/Google Pay, Link atď.). "
"Prijímané sú len platby chronmi, a to pri priamom odmeňovaní projektu aj pri "
"objednávkach tretích strán na /rewpro. Neprihlásení návštevníci sú vyzvaní na "
"prihlásenie. Existujúce objednávky v procese platby nie sú ovplyvnené; "
"blokované sú len nové platby."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:1256
msgid "Please !login or !register to pay with Chrons."
msgstr "Na zaplatenie chronmi sa prosím !login alebo !register."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:2248
msgid "Only Chron payments are accepted right now."
msgstr "Momentálne sú prijímané len platby chronmi."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_project_reward/rovas_project_reward.module:2252
msgid "Please log in to pay with Chrons."
msgstr "Na platbu chronmi sa prosím prihláste."

#: sites/all/modules/custom/rovas_stripe_express_checkout/includes/init.inc:49
msgid "Card payments are disabled."
msgstr "Platby kartou sú vypnuté."
